docs/planning/decisions.md:507:## D034 — Chunk reviews at 8/10; phase sign-off at 9/10 with every chunk raised
docs/planning/decisions.md-508-
docs/planning/decisions.md-509-Decided by the owner on 2026-10-18 during C08 ("from now on the chunk reviews
docs/planning/decisions.md-510-just need to clear a 8/10, but the phases themselves must continue to achieve a
docs/planning/decisions.md-511-9/10 or higher ... each chunk will be pushed to achieve a 9/10 or higher before
docs/planning/decisions.md-512-the phase is signed off on"); recorded by the implementer. Supersedes D032's
docs/planning/decisions.md-513-case-by-case acceptance for chunks.
docs/planning/decisions.md-514-
docs/planning/decisions.md-515-- A chunk completes on a Codex review whose five scores are all at least 8
docs/planning/decisions.md-516-  with no blockers, through `xtask complete --owner-accept REASON`; required
docs/planning/decisions.md-517-  fixes, evidence gaps and the fail recommendation may remain and are
docs/planning/decisions.md:518:  recorded (`owner_acceptance.decision = "D034"`). Everything else (packet,
docs/planning/decisions.md-519-  verdict, transport, fingerprints, runs, native evidence) must still check.
docs/planning/decisions.md-520-- A phase review is never owner-accepted: it needs 9/10 in all five scores
docs/planning/decisions.md-521-  with empty required fixes, blockers and evidence gaps (`xtask complete`
docs/planning/decisions.md-522-  refuses `--owner-accept` for a phase).
docs/planning/decisions.md-523-- Before the phase review, every chunk in the phase whose current completion
docs/planning/decisions.md-524-  was owner-accepted is remediated and re-reviewed until it passes the full
docs/planning/decisions.md-525-  9/10 gate, then completed as a new generation without reopening later
docs/planning/decisions.md-526-  chunks. `xtask complete` refuses a phase while any member chunk's current
docs/planning/decisions.md-527-  completion is owner-accepted.
